MinerU (Parsing Engine Integration)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  This project integrates with MinerU as an external parsing/OCR service via HTTP API
  (e.g. cloud endpoint: https://mineru.net/api/v4; local/self-host deployments are also supported).

  Source (open-source project):
    https://github.com/opendatalab/MinerU

  License:
    The license of MinerU itself is defined by the upstream MinerU project. This distribution
    applies MinerU notices for integration usage; MinerU source code is not bundled here.

